        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>When the world ends, who will you spend your final hours with? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >─────────────────────────────────</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>bygone snow</i> is a visual novel for the GBA. The game was made in exactly two weeks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short story (around 30 minutes) about two people and their relationship as their time comes to an end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack by Kishan02 and Mireille Scieppan.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a ROM made for the GBA, and can thus be played on anything that plays GBA games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windows emulated version that is set to try and visually mimic the looks of a GBA, and with controls set to mirror your typical PC visual novels. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >─────────────────────────────────</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is part of the Garenburg series, but it is a standalone title that requires no previous information to play.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>When the world ends, who will you spend your final hours with? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >─────────────────────────────────</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>bygone snow</i> is a visual novel for the GBA. The game was made in exactly two weeks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short story (around 30 minutes) about two people and their relationship as their time comes to an end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack by Kishan02 and Mireille Scieppan.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a ROM made for the GBA, and can thus be played on anything that plays GBA games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windows emulated version that is set to try and visually mimic the looks of a GBA, and with controls set to mirror your typical PC visual novels. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >─────────────────────────────────</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is part of the Garenburg series, but it is a standalone title that requires no previous information to play.</p>",
